    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Environment:</b><br/>
Brave | Windows 11|DemoQA</p>

<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://demoqa.com/text-box" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://demoqa.com/text-box</a></li>
	<li>Click on 'Elements' on the menu</li>
	<li>Click on Buttons (button 5)</li>
	<li>Observe the screen</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result:</b><br/>
Clicking the button triggers the expected action on the screen</p>

<p><b>Actual result:</b></p>


<p>Button is triggering no action on the screen. No visual feedback, no page change, no error message displayed</p>

<p><b>Severity:</b><br/>
High</p>

<p><b>Priority:</b><br/>
P1 </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
