    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Environment:</b><br/>
Brave | Windows 11|Herokuapp</p>

<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to <a href="https://the-internet.herokuapp.com" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://the-internet.herokuapp.com</a></li>
	<li>Click 'Broken Images' from the home page list</li>
	<li>Observe the images displayed on the page</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result:</b><br/>
All images load and display correctly on the page</p>

<p><b>Actual result:</b><br/>
Three images fail to load. Broken image icons are displayed instead of the actual images. No error message is shown to the user.</p>

<p><b>Severity:</b><br/>
<span class="error">&#91;Critical / Major / Minor&#93;</span></p>

<p><b>Priority:</b><br/>
P3</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
