<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b></p>

<p>1.<a href="https://demo.opencart.com/en-gb/catalog/desktops" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://demo.opencart.com/en-gb/catalog/desktops</a>                             2.Click on Desktops in the navigation bar</p>

